# <TYPE>: <short summary in imperative mood>
#
# Types (pandas-style — pick one):
#   ENH:  new feature / brick
#   BUG:  bug fix
#   PERF: performance
#   REF:  refactor (no behavior change)
#   BLD:  build system / go.mod / install
#   CI:   GitHub Actions / hooks
#   DOC:  docs / README
#   TST:  tests
#   STY:  formatting only
#   API:  public API change
#   DIST: packaging / release artifacts
#   MAINT: chores, deps bump without feature
#
# Examples:
#   ENH: add Audience brick for segment sync
#   BUG: fix credentials path when HOME unset
#   CI: run go test on pull requests
#
# Rules:
#   - Subject ≤ 72 chars, no trailing period
#   - Do NOT mention Cursor, Codex, Copilot, ChatGPT, or "AI generated"
#   - Do NOT add Co-authored-by for tools/agents
